:''Not to be confused with [[Gold Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Gold Cat]].''
'''Gold Brick Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a Stamp Reward during the game's anniversary. He was added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]]. [[True Form]] improves health and grants [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic Immunity]].

